ed, which involves creating a player and taking him through a career. The Master League mode saw the introduction of two-tier negotiations, which involve negotiating with the club first and then the player separately. The Edit Mode was also improved.\n\nThe game was followed by PES 2010.", "themes": [{"id": 32, "name": "Non-fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/pro-evolution-soccer-2009", "videos": [{"id": 146639, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "WRCAa9eu-s8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WRCAa9eu-s8", "title": "PES 2009 Champions League Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WRCAa9eu-s8/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 146640, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "B1nF83j6So8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B1nF83j6So8", "title": "Pro Evolution Soccer 2009 - Messi Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/B1nF83j6So8/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 146641, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "Wvhjxf5C4zs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Wvhjxf5C4zs", "title": "PES 2009 - Pro Evolution Soccer (Intro)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Wvhjxf5C4zs/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 146642, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "FRQkYtE1lr0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FRQkYtE1lr0", "title": "PES 2009 (PC) - Gameplay", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FRQkYtE1lr0/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 195, "name": "Pro Evolution Soccer"}, {"id": 8363, "name": "World Soccer Winning Eleven"}]}